{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"The City (Manhattan)","id":"860473039098740766","name":"the-subway-pub-back-room","position":58,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"If you have not been shown to this room by some one in the subway pub, you may not interact here.","type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"(~~but did you get ashes in your eyelashes~~)\n'I'm glad you all survived. For a given value of survived, anyway... you seem to be adapting to the transition faster than me, at least.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:32:23.234000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869905122392686602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Well,\" she shrugs. \"I'm still getting used to it. It's my third body though, and I think I'm an adaptable sort.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:34:20.784000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869905615433117746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'Maybe I had such trouble because of... the whole dead thing, then. Everyone else I've seen seems to be at least functional, albeit Willow's... not really happy... I can understand it, but I'm unsure how to help.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:35:59.695000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869906030295941140","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'I don't know what I was before dying, and at this point I've accepted I'm likely not going to know - but if I were to find out, be able to go back to it, and then have it ripped away again...'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:36:45.926000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869906224202776577","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Willow went to a lot of trouble to be in the body she loved...\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:37:02.241000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869906292632854598","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I, well, the first time to be honest I just wanted out of the body I was caged in. Same as you, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:37:32.572000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869906419850313822","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"she nods. 'That's why I asked the Ravens to take it in exchange for answering my questions. Though I was under a lot of stress at the time...'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:38:13.994000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869906593586745384","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"before a wry grin, 'If I had been more focused I would have asked for something that could actually reach the top shelf.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:38:35.637000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869906684364087317","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Well, you certainly jump better than anyone.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:39:00.565000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869906788919701576","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"And help, help from others is always good.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:39:10.178000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869906829239550003","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'What's jumping compared to flying, though?'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:39:32.199000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869906921602293790","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I wouldn't know. Not used to it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:42:16.103000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869907609065496576","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Did you know I walked all the way here?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:42:26.933000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869907654489800774","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I guess... same with you. We've got bodies built to do stuff we're not used to doing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:42:55.315000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869907773532536902","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'I didn't, but I am not surprised. It took me a while to get used to hops, and even now I still don't always use them.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:43:01.098000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869907797788217344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'As for swimming... I'm used to just walking along the bottom of the river.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:43:13.148000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869907848329576458","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'And don't even get me started on breathing.' she lets out a soundless laugh. 'Breathing, eating, drinking, everything like that, how do you living people cope with it?'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:43:43.759000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869907976721403925","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I've done it for 800 years,\" she shrugs. \"It's as natural as.... well, breathing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:44:12.280000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869908096347144212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"She exhales through her new nose, as she releases another shot from her revolver.","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:44:35.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869908195341135912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'I've done it for less than two weeks, after months of not. I still forget sometimes... fortunately my body doesn't seem to.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:44:51.753000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869908261908938753","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"That's because you have to.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:45:29.238000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869908419132411915","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"Another shot.","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:45:33.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869908438946308107","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Someone in my life used to say...\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:45:43.192000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869908477659725895","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"If you try to stop yourself from breathing, your body takes over and does it on its own.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:46:03.200000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869908561579368468","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'A useful function. Everything is so much more... vibrant now, too. Not always in a good way, either...'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:47:19.260000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869908880598134834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Yes, I love your colors!\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:48:01.976000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869909059762020352","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"she shrugs, cheeks puffing out a little. 'I meant my perception of things, but thank you.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:48:34.583000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869909196525682719","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'Light is no longer painful on my skin, but it's brighter on my eyes. Smells I would previously not notice, I do now. It's still a struggle to get used to.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:50:08.532000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869909590576349274","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Sorry for misunderstanding. I still meant what I said though. I don't pick up stuff like that all too well.\" She knocks her head with her talons. \"Still the same head in here, even with the new body.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:50:35.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869909702702678076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'Well, if I hadn't realised it was you, I would have by now.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:51:20.688000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869909893220532224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'I haven't really noticed it in myself, but Kukudh is definitely more vibrant. I'm glad for them.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:52:52.996000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869910280388378704","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Hah. That's never changing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:52:53.470000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869910282376462386","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'...though I suppose in a way, that's noticing it in a part of myself...' she gets as lost in thought as safely possible while practising with a gun, which is not very.","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:53:36.226000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869910461708120077","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Well, we'll take the time get used to our new bodies but well, you've got a little hope in your step, and I have the wind beneath my wings. Pun intended on both accounts.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:55:38.987000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869910976605069382","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'That's Kukudh's style of puns there. A bad one and a bird one.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:56:37.056000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869911220164128818","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"They were both bad.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:57:17.710000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869911390679355423","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'I suppose the second one was... ill-eagle.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:57:34.929000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869911462901075998","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Hm. Where is Kukudh?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:58:59.173000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869911816246014052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'Ah, they're at the Voice. Eliza and Vivica are resting after the rescue mission, so I might need to get back there at a moment's notice.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T11:59:45.264000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869912009565679657","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Oh, they're back! Nice to know everything that happened tonight ws successful.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:00:15.359000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869912135793258506","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'Back, but... they'll need some help.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:00:53.274000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869912294820294687","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'They're traumatised by it, the Redcoats used... awful methods... I'm hoping Mender will be able to help them cope, but I feel like it's more Ravens' domain.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:02:19.832000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869912657870852115","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I... yes. Muninn and Willow's specifically, as Memory. One of the tenets of the ravens is to heal others of the trauma of memory.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:03:51.036000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869913040408150086","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"she sighs. 'I apologise if I'm overstepping my bounds here. But I am worried about Willow... I feel closer to her than she feels to me - which, understandable, given how little life experience I retain - so I'm not sure if it's appropriate for me to try and help her through this.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:05:39.450000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869913495129427969","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I will always endorse the help of others,\" Irynx nods. \"And better you than me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:07:07.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869913862378520596","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'I thought you would be her best help, being her fellow priestess?'","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:08:05.925000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869914109490114561","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Things between me and Willow might be... complicated.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:08:12.050000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869914135180242944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Just before we left for Niflheim, I was hoping to tell her about my... preferences, or lack of it. My ravens seemed to have picked up that she might, feel something for me in a way I can't return.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:08:42.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869914262125035520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'...ah.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:08:59.114000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869914332580945947","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'I can see how that might make assistance awkward, then...'","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:09:26.211000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869914446234013747","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I've lived a really long life. I know where I stand with all *that*. I trust that she'll respect it but with our non-conversation still hanging in the air, things'll be real awkward, yeah.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:10:48.730000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869914792343769148","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"'And I thought I had it complicated with the whole 'being dead' thing before.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T12:11:15.388000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869914904155537459","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
